"geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="76" value="LogoutController.logout() (US2) returns False if there is no userId in the session, otherwise it clears the session and returns True - the US40 control just returns that.&#10;Follow-up GET is handled by the existing PlatformManagerLoginPage (US39); platformManagerLogin.html displays the one-time flashed message." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="962" width="1240" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>